<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on SMH.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on SMH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued a total of one million American-style call warrants on Ste Suisse Microelectronique et d'Horlogerie SA registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Two warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    190.00 SFR		PREMIUM	13.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     11.45 SFR		 GEARING	8.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.OCT.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	02.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  187.50 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
